Life Logger — installed package
===============================

Server bundle: /usr/lib/lifelogger/server.js
Web app:       /usr/lib/lifelogger/web
Version file:  /usr/lib/lifelogger/version
Configuration: /etc/lifelogger.env   (preserved on upgrade)
Data:          /var/lib/lifelogger   (not owned by this package)

Commands
--------

  systemctl status lifelogger
  journalctl -u lifelogger -n 100
  curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8080/health

  lifelogger-update <version>       upgrade from a GitHub release
  /usr/lib/lifelogger/backup.sh     manual database backup
  /usr/lib/lifelogger/restore.sh <backup.db> --yes

Source and runbook: https://github.com/Marvelous616/you
